<title>USA: Iowa-S Minn cattle market not well tested - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-S Minn cattle market not well tested - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Steers and heifers were not tested, compared with Thursday's close, USDA said.</p>
<p>On a carcass basis, steers and heifers not well tested. Heifers:  Select to mostly Choice 2-4 1150 lbs ld 109.00 Reported sales for Fri: 100   Week to Date: 100</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720--</p>
